    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Imagine an unfortunate typo leads NBC to produce <i>America’s Got Talons</i>, where celebrity judges fight off a series of clawed animals.",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "Ce Puma vient de manger Tyra ! ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "723524_2",
      "n": "CategoryAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Les koalas ont des griffes. Et croyez-moi, si vous ratez votre performance, HEIDI aussi. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "723536_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio3"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
